  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Bitcoin -- the original peer-to-peer digital currency and most secure blockchain in existence. Anchors OASIS holon hashes and avatar data to Bitcoin transactions, providing immutable, censorship-resistant persistence backed by Bitcoin's global hash power. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture -- 55+ networks, Write-Once-Deploy-Everywhere. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
